{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_09_beg","storyGroup":"act40side","storySort":17,"storyDependence":"act40side_level_act40side_08_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OR-9","storyName":"长寿面\n","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"岁兽一事终于还是到了最后的关头。玉门城楼上，梁洵面对太傅坦白了自己在事件中的行动。在城外古寺，两位许久不见的代理人重新聚首。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act40side/level_act40side_09_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act40side_09","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":15,"next":17,"characters":["“禁军小教头”","煌","？？？","麟青砚","解真","太合","太傅","梁洵","路过的老人","小大厨","车夫"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":7},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_bg_30_ex1_snowmount.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":8},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.2","yFrom":"0","yTo":"70","duration":"4","block":"false","id":9},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_lightsnow","layer":"1","id":10},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"1","id":11},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":12},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"subtitle","text":"离维多利亚已经不远了......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":15},{"type":"subtitle","text":"又下雪了......她们应该已经换上冬衣了吧。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":16},{"type":"subtitle","id":17},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":19},{"type":"backgroundtween","yFrom":"70","yTo":"-80","duration":"6","ease":"OutQuad","block":"false","id":20},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":21},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":22},{"type":"charslot","id":23},{"type":"background","id":24},{"type":"gridbg","imagegroup":"47_g14_skyovercast_L1/47_g14_skyovercast_R1/47_g14_skyovercast_L2/47_g14_skyovercast_R2","solidwidth":"1280/1280/1280/1280","solidheight":"720/720/720/720","x":"-640","fadetime":"1","id":25},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"25","yFrom":"720","yTo":"360","block":"false","id":26},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":27},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":29},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":30},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":31},{"type":"subtitle","text":"小时候就像个小火炉，一腔热血，想来是不怕这样一点风雪的。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":32},{"type":"subtitle","text":"百灶没有这样冷的冬天，她说等开春的时候，第一卷书应该已经写成了。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":33},{"type":"subtitle","text":"如此就好......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":34},{"type":"subtitle","text":"浮生至此，了无挂怀。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":35},{"type":"subtitle","id":36},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":37},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":38},{"type":"text","text":"男人脱下官服，仔细折叠整齐，和随身带的书籍放在一处，向东边的方向再三拜首。","id":39},{"type":"text","text":"他走出了营地。","id":40},{"type":"dialog","id":41},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":42},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"1","id":43},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":44},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":45},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":46},{"type":"gridbg","id":47},{"type":"charslot","id":48},{"type":"bgeffect","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":50},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing3","volume":"1","id":52},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_large","layer":"1","id":53},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.01","block":"true","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":55},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_bladeline_01_large","x":"116.1","y":"0","rox":"-60.2","roy":"0","roz":"16","layer":"2","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":57},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing4","volume":"1","id":58},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.01","block":"true","id":59},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":60},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_bladeline_01_large","x":"120.1","y":"-103.4","rox":"-60.2","roy":"145","roz":"16","layer":"3","id":61},{"type":"delay","time":"0.6","id":62},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fireburst","id":63},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_magic_fire_01","y":"-650","x":"300","layer":"4","delay":"0.2","id":64},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_magic_fire_01","y":"-650","x":"-300","layer":"5","delay":"0.2","id":65},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":66},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"0.4","g":"0.1","b":"0.1","fadetime":"1.5","block":"false","id":67},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_magic_fire_01","y":"-550","x":"450","layer":"1","delay":"0.4","id":68},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_magic_fire_01","y":"-550","x":"-450","layer":"2","delay":"0.4","id":69},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_magic_fire_01","y":"-450","x":"650","layer":"3","delay":"0.6","id":70},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_magic_fire_01","y":"-450","x":"-650","layer":"4","delay":"0.6","id":71},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":72},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":73},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":74},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":76},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":77},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_burn","layer":"1","id":78},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_bat_act23side_01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act23side/m_bat_act23side_01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":79,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":80},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":81},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ftrub","volume":"1","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#8$1","posfrom":"600,0","posto":"0,-10","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,-10","posto":"0,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"你的火的确变得更烫了。","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"感染者，你的源石技艺对自己身体的消耗很大。","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$3","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"开始怕热了吗？","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"呵，这不过是我一个人的血......我清楚，我之所以还能站在这里，是因为已经有太多人流过血。","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#1$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"看来你已经知道了很多。","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$3","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"算不上很多，但最重要的是，我只要知道一件事就够了——","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"那些被掩盖掉姓名的人，那些死得不明不白的人......都不能就这样算了。","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#3$3","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"说真的，我从来没有想过自己的身世还会牵扯出这么复杂的故事，也没有想过自己还有为感染者而战之外的使命。","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$3","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"但是我想明白了，道理是一样的。我的血，是为制止我看到的一切不公义的事情而流的。","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#1$1","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"以血引火......感染者，你倒有几分古时义士之风。","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#7$1","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"但现在你一叶障目，最好不要轻易谈什么公正。","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"无论如何，我受命要将你带回，断不可再放走你......","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$3","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我知道，我知道......我见过你这种人。","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"或许不能简单地说你们是坏人，你们只是被训练成这副无血无泪的样子......所以别人的血和泪，你们也不在乎。","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$3","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"没有关系，我不会和你讲什么道理——你大可以试着拦住我。","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#3$1","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"虽是贼寇乱党......勇气可嘉。","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#1$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"当心点，我会留你一命，但未必能保你四肢健全。","id":114},{"type":"dialog","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"纵贯白雷正法，破！","id":117},{"type":"dialog","id":118},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#6$1","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":121},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"1","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#7$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-500,50","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.4","id":123},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":124},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"1","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_lightningmagic","volume":"1","id":126},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":127},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"bgeffect","id":129},{"type":"charslot","id":130},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":131},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drkcludsthdr","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"d","id":134},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":135},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$3","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你......","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"我知道你有很多话想说，但是当务之急只有一件。","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你不是要去见真龙吗，我来帮你。","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#8$1","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"麟青砚？你应该在狱中！","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"但我现在站在你面前。","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#8$1","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"手下败将，你输给过我一次。这一次，你们两个，都别想走。","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#14$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"放心，我也没有打算和你单挑。","id":151},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"charslot","id":153},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#8$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"虽说是我提议要来的......","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"可招惹到的这个对手......不好对付啊。","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#7$1","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"还有同伙......","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"是你将她从大狱中带出来的......","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#1$1","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"用了点粗暴手段，但尽可能避免伤及无辜了。","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"债多了不愁，我有那么多罪责难逃，也不差这一桩。等这边事了，我投案服法便是。","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1618_1#5$1","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"解真","text":"只是当下，该办的事，该见的人，都需要一个结果。","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#7$1","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"肃政院御史，大理寺少卿，协同犯上作乱......我从未见过如此荒唐的场面。","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"既然已经足够荒唐，那便再算我一个吧。","id":170},{"type":"dialog","id":171},{"type":"charslot","id":172},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_299_1#6$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":174},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"小教头，别来无恙。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#6$1","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"太合？！你不是在玉门受了重伤——","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_299_1#2$1","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"是......伤得有点重了。身上这点功夫，还有没有原来三成都不好说。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"所以今天，还是希望尽可能不要动手的。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#1$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"为什么，连你也要参与进来......","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_299_1#1$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"麟少卿来得突然，我还来不及了解事情全貌。但二位都是我最敬佩的同僚，我也只能以故友身份，劝二位留一丝和谈的余地。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#7$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"你们执意要做这般大逆不道之事，还指望我视若不见吗？","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_299_1#1$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"“取忠舍义”......但谁说，这二者只能选其一呢。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#4$1","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"公义......","id":191},{"type":"dialog","id":192},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0","channel":"d","fadetime":"0.5","id":193},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":195},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":196},{"type":"charslot","id":197},{"type":"background","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":199},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":200},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这桩罪案你已知晓，涉事的两人就在你眼前。","x":"150","y":"180","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"600","id":201},{"type":"subtitle","text":"孰是孰非，孰生孰死，选择在你。","x":"150","y":"180","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"600","id":202},{"type":"subtitle","text":"可是师父......这件事缘由复杂，善恶岂能轻易——","x":"600","y":"480","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"600","id":203},{"type":"subtitle","text":"剑在你手中，做出选择！","x":"150","y":"180","alignment":"center","size":"30","delay":"0.04","width":"600","id":204},{"type":"subtitle","text":"师父......！","x":"600","y":"480","alignment":"center","size":"35","delay":"0.04","width":"600","id":205},{"type":"subtitle","text":"还不动手？！","x":"150","y":"180","alignment":"center","size":"40","delay":"0.04","width":"600","id":206},{"type":"subtitle","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":208},{"type":"subtitle","text":"师父，如果公义只能在剑锋之上得到伸张，那“公义”与“暴力”何异？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":209},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我不明白......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":210},{"type":"subtitle","id":211},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":214},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":215},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":217},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"d","fadetime":"0.5","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#16$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"不要逗留，快进去！","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#7$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"休想——","id":223},{"type":"dialog","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":225},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hornstart","volume":"1","id":226},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#6$1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"这是，禁城撤防的信号......？","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"陛下......难道？","id":230},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":232},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":233},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":234},{"type":"charslot","id":235},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_bg_35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#7$1","id":237},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":238},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":241},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#2$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"从这里看过去，都已经能看到禁城了。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"上一次站在这城楼上的时候，还是春天。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"......这半年着实发生了不少事。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"天气已经凉了，城头风大。太傅注意身体。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"朝堂诸公，想来是没有几个人从这个角度看过百灶的。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"登高望远，也总有浮云遮目，不见得总能看得清的。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"......行事当思进退。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"你知道，我当初让你来担任玉门参知是何意？","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"私以为，是太傅想让在下开拓眼界，见识大局。是给在下的机会，也是考验。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"于何事的考验？","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"......是否堪当大用。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"那你知道，今天我叫你来是何意？","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"是太傅，对在下失望了。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"是推脱堂皇之词，还是当真作此想？","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"在下清楚，先前百珍宴之举，是下下之策。可是也别无他法。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"......迫使百珍宴中断，不给太尉先斩后奏、倒逼真龙的机会。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"......","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"自从你卷入这一系列纷争中，三次陷入抉择，而每次都是行最险的棋。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"你将你的朋友，连带你自己，一同放在这棋盘上......你就从来没有犹豫过？","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"在下不敢说毫无私情......可再三权衡，唯有顾全大局。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"......算得上能谋，但不可谓善断。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"我本想挑选一位有抱负而无贪欲，有手腕而无私心的年轻才干，多给些历练的机会。如有可能，便可以大事相托。","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"我原本以为，你是一个合适的人选......可执棋者以身作子，大多是不得善终的。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"你让我想起一位同僚......已经是位故去之人了。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"在下惭愧......","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"......梁洵，如果再给你一次机会选择，你可还愿意离开尚蜀？","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"在下在求学之初，立志要让毕生所学为天下人所用。至于身居何位，不过是机遇使然......","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"在下初心不曾变过，也不会为做过的选择后悔。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"嗯......","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"百珍宴的意外，需要一个说法。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"在下甘愿服法。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"......","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"天镜阁的藏书楼缺一位誊录郎，明天起你就去那里任职吧。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"......多谢太傅。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":302},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":303},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gintcrturvive","volume":"1","id":304},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_collapse","volume":"0.5","id":305},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":306},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":307},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"90","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":308},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":309},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"8","id":310},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drkcludsthdr","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"d","id":311},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":312},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"1","id":313},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"这是......","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"......终于是要到了。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":319},{"type":"text","text":"云积得很厚，遮住了圆月清光。","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"太傅曾见过那个人......？","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"不曾。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"这局棋上，他求的对手，究竟是谁呢......","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"有时棋局上，所求的并非与对手的输赢，而是一个解法。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"......在无数变化中，寻求一个双方都可接受的两全之解。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"......","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"在下想要请教太傅......","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"您当初，是为何决定，要设下那一场大考？","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_301_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"......","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":337},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":338},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":339},{"type":"charslot","id":340},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":341},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":342},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_livelyrestaurant","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"l","id":343},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"l","fadetime":"2","id":344},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":345},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":346},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":347},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"l","fadetime":"2","id":348},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_ouat_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":349,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#5$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":351},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的老人","text":"店家，还没打烊吧？","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"赶得真巧，做完你这单生意就打烊了。不过时候确实晚了，店里剩的吃的也不多了。要点什么？","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#5$1","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的老人","text":"不挑，随便买点能路上充饥的就行。","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"那正好这里还剩半笼肉包子，早上做的，也不要钱了。","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#5$1","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的老人","text":"这么做生意，那不就成了亏本买卖？","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#5$1","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"是啊，我本来就只会做饭，不太会做生意。","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#5$1","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的老人","text":"这么好的手艺，就不想靠它挣些名利？","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"有什么用呢？王侯贵胄，贩夫走卒，谁不都还是吃一日三餐。挣什么名利，还不如蒸包子有意思。","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的老人","text":"多嘴一问，平时百姓来这里吃一餐饭要多少钱？","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"不贵不贵，最平常的两菜一汤，几块钱就能打发了。","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"只要是能在百灶有份活计，就能在这家饭馆里吃饱饭。","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#5$1","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的老人","text":"看来店家竟然有颗济世仁心。","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#5$1","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"别别，您可别这么说我......我就只是一介厨师，每天能招待的客人，撑死也不过百来号人。","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"要想让全天下人都衣食无忧，那只能靠您多费心了。","id":378},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#5$1","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的老人","text":"白吃你一顿包子，还能听到一个教训......不亏。","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"哈哈，我平时就喜欢和客人聊天，东拉西扯的，说话也没个边儿，您别生我的气就行。","id":382},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的老人","text":"没记错的话，这家店开了也挺长一段时间了，盈亏如何？","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#7$1","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"唉......这可就头疼了。您看，我这小店一年到头，也就勉强回本。","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"要是今年大荒城粮产缺了些，或者驰道不通，货物运输慢了些，我这小饭馆成本高了，这里的人也就吃不到这个价格的饭了。","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的老人","text":"你这是在替其他几位邀功？","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#5$1","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"哈哈......可是账还没算完呢。","id":391},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"来这吃饭的都是街坊邻居，有人吃完饭赊了一点饭钱，要么送我几大箱新鲜水果，要么包圆了屋里的家具维修......","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"要是没了他们关照，这家小饭馆还是开不下去。","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#18$1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"所以说，这笔账实在不好算呀......","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"做生意不就是这样，谁说一定要你死我活呢？有来有往，和气生财，生意才能做得长久嘛。","id":397},{"type":"dialog","id":398},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":399},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"太傅大人，半笼包子，给您装好了。您要不先尝尝？","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#5$1","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"......味道是不错。","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"别学那个做生意的说话。","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":405},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"l","fadetime":"2","id":406},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"4","id":407},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":408},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":409},{"type":"charslot","id":410},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":411},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":412},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":413},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#5$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":415},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车夫","text":"大人，您买完饭了？","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#5$1","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"嗯，听说这家包子的味道是百灶一绝，分你一个尝尝。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车夫","text":"唔......嗯......好吃，真好吃。","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车夫","text":"行，吃点东西也有劲赶路了。咱们去哪？","id":423},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"......尚蜀。","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":426},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":427},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":428},{"type":"charslot","id":429},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":430},{"type":"gridbg","imagegroup":"47_g15_eveningglow_L1/47_g15_eveningglow_R1/47_g15_eveningglow_L2/47_g15_eveningglow_R2","solidwidth":"1280/1280/1280/1280","solidheight":"720/720/720/720","x":"-640","fadetime":"1","id":431},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"60","yFrom":"360","yTo":"720","block":"false","id":432},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":433},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_livelystreet","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"l","id":434},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":435},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"l","fadetime":"2","id":436},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":437},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":438},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":439},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":440},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":441},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......怎么走的来着？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":442},{"type":"subtitle","text":"城东七街五坊，我记得要路过一家染坊，一家瓷窑......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":443},{"type":"subtitle","text":"嗐，都晕了头，好多年没来过了，早就不知道变成什么——哦？这家字画店竟然还在？上面这块招牌都要变成文物了吧......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":444},{"type":"subtitle","text":"改天可以来逛逛，说不定能找到——唉，应该还是找不到的吧。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":445},{"type":"subtitle","id":446},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"l","fadetime":"2","id":447},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":448},{"type":"subtitle","text":"唔，好像快到了......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":449},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这座古寺还是一点没变，这些年没人来过，竟然也没拆......到底是谁念旧呢？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":450},{"type":"subtitle","id":451},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ironchaindrop","volume":"1","id":452},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":453},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......锁已经打开了？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":454},{"type":"subtitle","id":455},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_door","volume":"1","id":456},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":457},{"type":"subtitle","text":"呀，你已经回来了。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":458},{"type":"subtitle","id":459},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":460},{"type":"charslot","id":461},{"type":"background","id":462},{"type":"image","id":463}],"characters":["“禁军小教头”","煌","？？？","麟青砚","解真","太合","太傅","梁洵","路过的老人","小大厨","车夫"]}